message: "If you use this formalization, cite it via this metadata."
title: "hadamard-formal: Lean verification of eight Hadamard orders unrecorded in the Cati-Pasechnik database"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization proving Hadamard existence at eight
  orders from 2884 through 11948, each listed as not recorded known in Table
  4 of the Cati-Pasechnik construction database (arXiv:2411.18897v2,
  2025-08-30), via the Goethals-Seidel and Cooper-Wallis constructions and
  kernel-checked periodic T-matrix and Williamson witnesses. It also proves
  the erratum core of the companion Hadamard-M note on Miyamoto 1991: the
  handshake parity obstruction, its empty-class corollary, and the
  nonexistence of the displayed C2-matrix ingredient of that paper's
  Corollary 4 at every positive block order not congruent to 1 mod 4 -
  closing both printed readings of the corollary and leaving its order-515
  claim, a Hadamard matrix of order 2060, unsupported by the paper's own
  machinery.
